---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Curriculum Vitae | Academic Portfolio"
  description="Curriculum vitae and academic history module under structural preparation."
  activeNav="cv"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <header class="border-b border-stone-200 pb-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-stone-200 text-stone-800 text-xs font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
        Module Status: Structural Preparation
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-stone-950 tracking-tight">
        Curriculum Vitae
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-stone-600 font-serif italic">
        Academic credentials, research appointments, and institutional service.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-stone-800 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        This section is currently reserved for the formal academic curriculum vitae. In accordance with the project data isolation protocols established for this portfolio, professional history and biographical records remain isolated within the local repository context until formal synthesis.
      </p>

      <p>
        Subsequent releases will incorporate complete chronological documentation covering higher education degrees, academic research appointments, seminar presentations, policy consultancy engagements, and language proficiencies. Each entry will provide verifiable institutional affiliations without placeholder abstractions.
      </p>

      <p>
        Scholarly inquiries regarding primary fieldwork methodology, Caribbean migration governance datasets, or public administration evaluations may be directed through institutional academic communication channels.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="border border-stone-200 rounded-lg p-6 bg-white space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wider">
        Anticipated Curricular Sections
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-stone-700">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-stone-400 pl-3 py-1">
          <strong class="text-stone-900 block">Academic Education</strong>
          <span>Advanced degrees in European Studies and Public Administration</span>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-stone-400 pl-3 py-1">
          <strong class="text-stone-900 block">Research Fieldwork</strong>
          <span>Primary organizational fieldwork with frontline antitrafficking agencies</span>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-stone-400 pl-3 py-1">
          <strong class="text-stone-900 block">Policy Analysis</strong>
          <span>Constitutional Kingdom Charter and OCT framework evaluations</span>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-stone-400 pl-3 py-1">
          <strong class="text-stone-900 block">Technical Competencies</strong>
          <span>Linux server administration, static web architectures, and data isolation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-stone-200">
      <a href="/" class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-stone-600 hover:text-stone-950 transition-colors">
        ← Return to Research Overview
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
